factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and slides say the collector flagged off the vehicles at Ripon Buildings campus; the article says so too, but the slide 'என்ன தொடக்கம்' wording is fine — no issue here. However, the reel_script says the project is run 'under Chennai Corporation' with the shelters, which matches the article.
  The reel_script states the collector 'visited the bakery food products' prepared by differently abled children; the article says she viewed the mobile display vehicle showing those products, so this is a minor overstatement but not a fabricated fact.
  The reel_script omits that the Hope Public Charitable Trust maintains the two shelters, which is an important fact about who runs the shelters (the article says the charitable organisation maintains them).
  The slide 'யாருக்கு பயன்?' says '60 பயனாளிகள் இங்கு தங்கியுள்ளனர்' attributing the 60 to both shelters combined, which matches the article's wording 'இக்காப்பகங்களில் சுமார் 60'; no problem.
  The slide 'மேலும் விவரம்' says the bakery items were made by 'மாற்றுத்திறனாளி குழந்தைகள்' (differently abled children); the article says this, so no problem.
